+/*
+ * Fill a "key\0value\0..." list describing the volume AFC_ROOT lives on.  The
+ * numbers are what the host uses to decide whether a push fits, so they must
+ * come from the live mount rather than from a constant: a hard-coded 16 GiB
+ * of free space makes every host over-commit a 128 GiB volume.
